        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Wood chips, mixed, u=120%, at forest</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Wood chips, mixed, u=120%, at forest
The volume refers to the bulked volume: dried matter content = 188.6 kg/m3 dried matter (u=0%), lower heating value = 3294 MJ/m3. Wood is unstored/undried and not stemming from short-rotation areas for energy wood production!;
Synonyms: Häcksel; 
UUID: 23e379e6-5be8-34a2-983f-abb6922efe1f
Includes the chopping of the average mix of 72% residual softwood and 28% residual hardwood (reflecting Swiss average wood consumption) with a mobile chopper in the forest. Also includes the driving of the mobile chopper to and within the forest
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Chopping with a large mobile chopper. Wood is unstored/undried and not stemming from short-rotation areas for energy wood production!
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: see Geography
Uncertainty adjustments: The assumption that Austria / Switzerland are representative for central Europe is considered in the uncertainties.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_23e379e6-5be8-34a2-983f-abb6922efe1f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
